    # game/mog_battle_expedition.rpy:2186
    old "• {b}W = PARRY{/b} — tight timing at impact. Negates the hit: +1⚡, +5 Confidence, feeds the Mog Meter, and counters."
    new "• {b}W = PARRY{/b} — timing preciso al impacto. Anula el golpe: +1⚡, +5 de confianza, llena el Mog Meter y contraataca."

    # game/mog_battle_expedition.rpy:2187
    old "• {b}S = DODGE{/b} — avoids the hit, earns nothing by itself. Take {b}zero hits{/b} across a whole attack — any mix of parries and dodges — and bank {b}+1⚡{/b}."
    new "• {b}S = ESQUIVAR{/b} — evita el golpe, pero no da nada por sí solo. Recibe {b}cero golpes{/b} durante un ataque completo, combinando parries y esquivas, y guarda {b}+1⚡{/b}."

    # game/mog_battle_expedition.rpy:2188
    old "• The enemy {b}glows{/b} before a hit: {color=#ff5d6c}{b}RED{/b}{/color} = can't be parried, dodge only. {color=#ffd75e}{b}YELLOW{/b}{/color} = parry or dodge. Watch for feints (delayed swings)."
    new "• El rival {b}brilla{/b} antes de golpear: {color=#ff5d6c}{b}ROJO{/b}{/color} = no admite parry, solo esquiva. {color=#ffd75e}{b}AMARILLO{/b}{/color} = parry o esquiva. Cuidado con las fintas (golpes retrasados)."

    # game/mog_battle_expedition.rpy:2189
    old "• {b}💥 HEAVY swings{/b} wind up slower, dive bigger, and hit much harder — the deep windup is your warning."
    new "• Los {b}💥 golpes PESADOS{/b} cargan más lento, se lanzan más y pegan mucho más fuerte. La carga profunda es tu aviso."

